  "body": "Minim 4.9.5.\n\n- Playback fix for YouTube cutting songs off with a 403 error: updated NewPipe Extractor (dev commit e8f8914) and audio is now fetched in 1 MB pieces, with automatic recovery if a link gets blocked mid-song.\n- Includes everything up to 4.9.4: Stats tab and daily recap, streaks, Artist pages, Discover, synced lyrics, volume boost, and the Dynamic / Default (black and white) colour switch.\n\nDownload Minim-v4.9.5.apk below and open it on your Android phone (Android 9 or newer)."
